  "comments": "A khu ching distinguishes a \"sbal ti jo sras\", author of a \"'du ba\" from \"sbal ti 'dul 'dzin\" (ID:8084) also an author of works on monastic rules, of a commentary on the Pr\u0101timok\u1e63as\u016btra (ID:3690), and on the Sum brgya ba  (see [5RXEUKD9]: 537, respectively No. 11709 and Nos. 11710-12).\r\n\r\n[JUARFJSX]: 71, n. 205 doubts the identification of \"brtson 'grus dbang phyug\" - the author of (ID:4720) - as sBal ti jo sras, suggesting, rather that the author could have been a student of Phya pa (ID:3831). In that case, (ID:4720) would be a different work from the one listed by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 529, No. 11509: sbal ti jo sras kyi 'dul ba).",
